# Site privacy (always)

This public site must stay free of sensitive personal details beyond the approved brand name **Tiffany Tindall**.

## Never add to the site, git, or commit messages

- Home address, neighborhood, or exact location
- Personal phone numbers or private family emails
- Student names, grades, or identifiable classroom photos without consent
- Unpublished employer internal details (staff-only emails, private Slack, and so on)
- Travel plans, "I will be at…", or live location

## Do not add these features unless Jeff explicitly asks

- Comment systems, chat, user accounts, or visitor sign-in
- Contact forms that store submissions
- Analytics, ads, or tracking pixels
- Maps that pin a home or school

Contact stays `SITE_CONTACT_EMAIL` from `.env`. Never commit the real email.

## Photos

Only images Tiffany approves for the public brand, under `public/images/` when that folder is in use.
